WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,010
Don't speak yet

2
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:04,430
Did something huge happen? — Yes.

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:06,190
Chen Zhuoyi is an old man from Long'an Bureau

4
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,550
What made him so sad?

5
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,910
Could it be a very serious case?

6
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:10,110
Director, let me ask you first.

7
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:11,390
Are you willing to do something because of a task?

8
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,950
subject to the highest confidentiality regulations

9
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,990
Even have to be monitored and protected for life

10
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:16,590
Are you scaring me?

11
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,830
How big of a case is it that you want me to keep it secret?

12
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:21,230
Just say whether you are willing or not. If you feel you can't afford it,

13
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,110
I'll file it right now and report over your head.

14
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,070
Get lost, I can't afford it

15
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,190
In our line of work, lifetime secrecy is the basic rule.

16
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:33,590
You're scaring me with this one, Old Chen.

17
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,350
Have you been under too much pressure lately?

18
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:36,510
How about I give you ten days' approval?

19
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:39,030
Five days. I will give you a five-day price. I guarantee you.

20
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,190
Every word I say is what I saw with my own eyes

21
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:43,350
What kind of reward is given by the system in this oil tray?

22
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:44,870
A complete set of technologies for commercial air-conditioning batteries

23
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,110
I don't know the specific purpose

24
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:50,790
I will apply and contact Academician Lin immediately so that he can evaluate it.

25
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:54,750
I believe you won't joke about this kind of thing, Old Chen

26
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,950
Go get that young man settled before the results come out

27
00:00:57,070 --> 00:01:02,070
Nothing can happen to him, Uncle Chen. Not even a scratch.

28
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:03,470
Is that technology actually useful?

29
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:09,140
The technology is still evaluating, so don’t think about it and take a rest.

30
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:10,820
I can tell you haven't slept well in a few days.

31
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:25,160
I'll come over right away. Xiao Chen's complete information is here.

32
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,320
Show it to me quickly

33
00:01:27,290 --> 00:01:32,280
Mr. Lin, please don’t rush. Please sit down. Mr. Lin, let me ask you a question first.

34
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,120
The information you just saw

35
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:37,790
How much is its value? Xiao Wang

36
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:39,030
You actually talked about value with me

37
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:40,510
This thing is priceless

38
00:01:40,630 --> 00:01:43,390
It's something that can completely change the world structure. You can think of everything.

39
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:44,670
things powered by batteries

40
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:46,190
There will be new changes

41
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:47,950
If our country had this technology

42
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,670
can leave the whole world behind

43
00:01:49,790 --> 00:01:50,790
future energy standards

44
00:01:50,910 --> 00:01:58,480
We have the final say. I am Wang Jianguo.

45
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,720
There is a top secret report
